NATIVE {"path":"/Users/kjopek/Workspace/safe-bash/tests/compatibility/bash-pipestatus-typed-native-preflight-review-20260829/REPORT.md","matches":[{"line":11,"text":"- P19: `declare -p PIPESTATUS`\n- P20: `readonly PIPESTATUS; false; declare -p PIPESTATUS`\n- P21: `false; readonly PIPESTATUS; true; declare -p PIPESTATUS`\n- P22: `f() { local PIPESTATUS; false | true; declare -p PIPESTATUS; }; false; f; declare -p PIPESTATUS`\n- P23: `f() { local -a PIPESTATUS; false | true; declare -p PIPESTATUS; }; false; f; declare -p PIPESTATUS`\n- P24: `PIPESTATUS=seed; false; declare -p PIPESTATUS`\n\nP19 has no prologue. Only fixed f invocations, shell builtins/declarations/assignments and two finite pipelines occur; no source/eval/variable-command/slash or failed lookup allowed. Empty stdin, zero fixtures, all file effects refused including old F05. No output/type/readonly policy inferred.\n\n## Source and lifetime scope\nThree modules changed: admission/entry/observation; six capture/lifecycle/group-observer/observer-state/state/storage bodies retain parent bytes. Parent SHA256 plus Git-blob identities authenticated against native26 source. Entry catch/finally tail unchanged; limits, FD validation and authenticated-start guards precede case launch. No fresh lifecycle fixture was needed for byte-identical ownership machinery; no old groups probed.\n\n## Pending actual authority\nFresh typed runtime review, ROOT GO and preprovision must be committed/pinned. UTC issued/expiry/latest-full600s-start remain PENDING. Fresh owned parents/empty journal and initially absent bootstrap captures required; actual descriptor/inode/read validation deferred. Resolve only ROOT_APPROVED_GRANT_SHA256 in command template d4e97d0e932825d3c8318792b2c2d98bd4aa997800805f95bdfa1f091326140e, obtain separate DATA slot review and exact require_escalated/login:false/no-prefix approval. No automatic activation.\n\nActual proposal600s inclusive/setup60/tail60/case3/TERM2/KILL1;29slots=7managed+4UNOBSERVEDstage reservations+18admin, peak5 proposal,32MiBcapture/128MiBwork/64KiBstreams. Not OS quota/universal census. Initial tool-shell startup trusted outside child fresh-env/capture qualification; no GNU5.3/fullBash claim. Older observations/source gaps/historical holds remain unchanged.\n"},{"line":12,"text":"- P20: `readonly PIPESTATUS; false; declare -p PIPESTATUS`\n- P21: `false; readonly PIPESTATUS; true; declare -p PIPESTATUS`\n- P22: `f() { local PIPESTATUS; false | true; declare -p PIPESTATUS; }; false; f; declare -p PIPESTATUS`\n- P23: `f() { local -a PIPESTATUS; false | true; declare -p PIPESTATUS; }; false; f; declare -p PIPESTATUS`\n- P24: `PIPESTATUS=seed; false; declare -p PIPESTATUS`\n\nP19 has no prologue. Only fixed f invocations, shell builtins/declarations/assignments and two finite pipelines occur; no source/eval/variable-command/slash or failed lookup allowed. Empty stdin, zero fixtures, all file effects refused including old F05. No output/type/readonly policy inferred.\n\n## Source and lifetime scope\nThree modules changed: admission/entry/observation; six capture/lifecycle/group-observer/observer-state/state/storage bodies retain parent bytes. Parent SHA256 plus Git-blob identities authenticated against native26 source. Entry catch/finally tail unchanged; limits, FD validation and authenticated-start guards precede case launch. No fresh lifecycle fixture was needed for byte-identical ownership machinery; no old groups probed.\n\n## Pending actual authority\nFresh typed runtime review, ROOT GO and preprovision must be committed/pinned. UTC issued/expiry/latest-full600s-start remain PENDING. Fresh owned parents/empty journal and initially absent bootstrap captures required; actual descriptor/inode/read validation deferred. Resolve only ROOT_APPROVED_GRANT_SHA256 in command template d4e97d0e932825d3c8318792b2c2d98bd4aa997800805f95bdfa1f091326140e, obtain separate DATA slot review and exact require_escalated/login:false/no-prefix approval. No automatic activation.\n\nActual proposal600s inclusive/setup60/tail60/case3/TERM2/KILL1;29slots=7managed+4UNOBSERVEDstage reservations+18admin, peak5 proposal,32MiBcapture/128MiBwork/64KiBstreams. Not OS quota/universal census. Initial tool-shell startup trusted outside child fresh-env/capture qualification; no GNU5.3/fullBash claim. Older observations/source gaps/historical holds remain unchanged.\n"}]}
